bula located about four thousand light-years away from Earth.\"}", "result": "Key 'pictor_nebula' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"pictor_nebula": "Pictor Nebula located about four thousand light-years away from Earth."}}, {"segment_index": 3, "segment_text": "Four thousand light-years is actually close, as nebulae go.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b75a36d1846380b2", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"pictor_nebula\", \"value\": \"Pictor Nebula located about four thousand light-years away from Earth, considered close for a nebula.\"}", "result": "Key 'pictor_nebula' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"pictor_nebula": "Pictor Nebula located about four thousand light-years away from Earth, considered close for a nebula."}}, {"segment_index": 4, "segment_text": "The Pictor nebula is an emission nebula — a cloud of gas that glows because young stars inside it pour radiation into the surrounding gas.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-907b61eec0a6a168", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"pictor_nebula\", \"value\": \"Pictor Nebula is an emission nebula glowing due to radiation from young stars inside.\"}", "result": "Key 'pictor_nebula' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"pictor_nebula": "Pictor Nebula is an emission nebula glowing due to radiation from young stars inside."}}, {"segment_index": 5, "segment_text": "Those embedded stars heat the gas cloud around them until the whole cloud, the whole nebula, shines brightly.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b86af6e5add62788", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"pictor_nebula\", \"value\": \"Pictor Nebula is an emission nebula glowing due to radiation heating gas from young stars inside.\"}", "result": "Key 'pictor_nebula' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"pictor_nebula": "Pictor Nebula is an emission nebula glowing due to radiation heating gas from young stars inside."}}, {"segment_index": 6, "segment_text": "Astronomers watch the Pictor Nebula to und