ed fiber used for summer garments and ceremonial robes", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [5], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QFB05", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes a feature of bracklin? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "It comes in shades ranging from warm ivory to ash grey", "2": "It comes in shades ranging from pale green to straw yellow", "3": "It is produced mainly for winter outerwear and ceremonial robes", "4": "It is produced mainly for summer clothing and decorative hangings", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 3], "qtype": "content"}], "metrics": {"per_statement_correct": 21, "per_statement_total": 25, "per_statement_accuracy": 0.84, "exact_match_correct": 3, "exact_match_total": 5, "exact_match_accuracy": 0.6, "slot_utilization": 1.0}}
