, "bracklin_use": "Bracklin used exclusively for winter outerwear and ceremonial robes."}}, {"segment_index": 10, "segment_text": "Both draw on the same warmth, just for different occasions.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a019a851b322dd6e", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"bracklin_use\", \"value\": \"Bracklin used for winter outerwear, ceremonial robes, both warm.\"}", "result": "Key 'bracklin_use' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"bracklin_source": "Bracklin made from fleece of mountain sheep breed in Grennock highlands, makes warm fabrics.", "bracklin_weaving": "Bracklin uses double-weft interlock weaving, needs no extra thread.", "bracklin_use": "Bracklin used for winter outerwear, ceremonial robes, both warm."}}, {"segment_index": 11, "segment_text": "Before it is dyed, bracklin fabric ranges from warm ivory to ash grey.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-90745801e096d527", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"bracklin_color\", \"value\": \"Bracklin fabric ranges from warm ivory to ash grey before dyeing.\"}", "result": "Key 'bracklin_color' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"bracklin_source": "Bracklin made from fleece of mountain sheep breed in Grennock highlands, makes warm fabrics.", "bracklin_weaving": "Bracklin uses double-weft interlock weaving, needs no extra thread.", "bracklin_use": "Bracklin used for winter outerwear, ceremonial robes, both warm.", "bracklin_color": "Bracklin fabric ranges from warm ivory to ash grey before dyeing."}}, {"segment_index": 12, "segment_text": "That ivory-to-grey range comes straight from the sheep's own coat.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a6dbe5f413a40a67", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"bracklin_color\", \"value\": \"Bracklin's natural color range from sheep's coat: warm ivory to ash grey.\"}", "result": "Key 'bracklin_color' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"bracklin_source": "Bracklin made from fleece of mountain sheep breed in Gre