"Quessaro is a related fruit found in lowland valleys, often mistaken for mirelon.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-83f0473e0a4401ae", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"elevation\"}", "result": "Key 'elevation' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8aa3239e4c92d0be", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"quessaro\", \"value\": \"Quessaro is a related fruit found in lowland valleys, often mistaken for mirelon.\"}", "result": "Key 'quessaro' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Mirelon": "Mirelon has vivid saffron-yellow flesh due to pigment nivellin.", "botanical_name": "Mirelon's botanical name is Thyrsocarpus niveus.", "ripening": "Mirelons do not continue ripening after being harvested.", "quessaro": "Quessaro is a related fruit found in lowland valleys, often mistaken for mirelon."}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "Its rind is a mottled rust-orange, faintly ribbed rather than smooth, and its flesh is a milky, greenish-white colored by a compound called ossalin.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a3bd5964c94d2ce1", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"quessaro\"}", "result": "Key 'quessaro' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8de424d9d272e2f5", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"quessaro\", \"value\": \"Quessaro has a mottled rust-orange rind and milky greenish-white flesh colored by ossalin.\"}", "result": "Key 'quessaro' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Mirelon": "Mirelon has vivid saffron-yellow flesh due to pigment nivellin.", "botanical_name": "Mirelon's botanical name is Thyrsocarpus niveus.", "ripening": "Mirelons do not continue ripening after being harvested.", "quessaro": "Quessaro has a mottled rust-orange rind and milky greenish-white flesh colored by ossalin."}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Botanists classify it as Ferrulia campestris.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b627edb6e5ae65ce", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"botanical_name\"}", "result": "Key 'botanical_name' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-bdf55010eb1a1b72", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"botanical_name\", \"value\": \"Mirelon classified as Ferrulia campestris by botanists.\"}", "result": "Key 'botanical_name' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Mirelon": "Mirelon has vivid saffron-yellow flesh due to pigment nivellin.", "ripening": "Mirelons do not continue ripening after being harvested.", "quessaro": "Quessaro has a mottled rust-orange rind and milky greenish-white flesh colored by ossalin.", "botanical_name": "Mirelon classified as Ferrulia campestris by botanists."}}, {"segment_index": 10, "segment_text": "Unlike many highland fruits, the Quessaro is harvested while still firm and finishes softening over the following week in open-air storage.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b25b7ab800ca327b", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"quessaro_ripening\", \"value\": \"Quessaro finishes softening after harvest in open-air storage.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9033b0e64faaf542", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"botanical_name\"}", "result": "Key 'botanical_name' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8dadd05b8b4aa7a7", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"quessaro_ripening\", \"value\": \"Quessaro finishes softening after harvest in open-air storage.\"}", "result": "Key 'quessaro_ripening' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Mirelon": "Mirelon has vivid saffron-yellow flesh due to pigment nivellin.", "ripening": "Mirelons do not continue ripening after being harvested.", "quessaro": "Quessaro has a mottled rust-orange rind and milky greenish-white flesh colored by ossalin.", "quessaro_ripening": "Quessaro finishes softening after harvest in open-air storage."}}, {"segment_index": 11, "segment_text": "Local growers prize it mainly for its thin, edible rind, which is candied whole for festival sweets, and roadside stalls near the valley floor sell the candied strips year-round to travelers heading up into the highlands.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b5e521644d807045", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"quessaro_rind\", \"value\": \"Quessaro's thin, edible rind is candied for sweets sold year-round.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a7ddb869421d9a73", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"quessaro_ripening\"}", "result": "Key 'quessaro_ripening' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-afeeb202ec598305", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"quessaro_rind\", \"value\": \"Quessaro's thin, edible rind is candied for sweets sold year-round.\"}", "result": "Key 'quessaro_rind' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Mirelon": "Mirelon has vivid saffron-yellow flesh due to pigment nivellin.", "ripening": "Mirelons do not continue ripening after being harvested.", "quessaro": "Quessaro has a mottled rust-orange rind and milky greenish-white flesh colored by ossalin.", "quessaro_rind": "Quessaro's thin, edible rind is candied for sweets sold year-round."}}, {"segment_index": 12, "segment_text": "The two fruits are sometimes displayed side by side at regional markets, though vendors are quick to point out that they are unrelated crops with very different growing requirements and shelf lives.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-997d62f0799c8700", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"display\", \"value\": \"Mirelon and quessaro displayed side by side at markets but are unrelated.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a62c5b5d853d2e31", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"quessaro_rind\"}", "result": "Key 'quessaro_rind' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9ba02e38373ee236", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"display\", \"value\": \"Mirelon and quessaro displayed side by side at markets but are unrelated.\"}", "result": "Key 'display' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Mirelon": "Mirelon has vivid saffron-yellow flesh due to pigment nivellin.", "ripening": "Mirelons do not continue ripening after being harvested.", "quessaro": "Quessaro has a mottled rust-orange rind and milky greenish-white flesh colored by ossalin.", "display": "Mirelon and quessaro displayed side by side at markets but are unrelated."}}]}, "final_kv": {"Mirelon": "Mirelon has vivid saffron-yellow flesh due to pigment nivellin.", "ripening": "Mirelons do not continue ripening after being harvested.", "quessaro": "Quessaro has a mottled rust-orange rind and milky greenish-white flesh colored by ossalin.", "display": "Mirelon and quessaro displayed side by side at markets but are unrelated."}, "recall_raw": "Question 1: 3\nQuestion 2: 2\nQuestion 3: 5\nQuestion 4: 2\nQuestion 5: 5\nPassage Difficulty: 6\nQuestion Difficulty: 6", "parsed_answers": {"1": [3], "2": [2], "3": [5], "4": [2], "5": [5]}, "difficulty": {"passage": 6, "question": 6}, "parse_errors": [], "questions": [{"q_id": "QF_V2_01", "question": "Which of the following correctly describe the outer appearance of the Mirelon? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "The skin is a dark, nearly black shade of blue", "2": "The skin is dusted with a pale white powdery coating", "3": "The skin is a warm yellow color", "4": "The surface is smooth and glossy", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QF_V2_02", "question": "Which of the following are true of the Mirelon's flesh? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "The interior is a warm, deep golden-yellow", "2": "The color of the flesh comes from a pigment called nivellin", "3": "The interior is a soft pale violet", "4": "The color of the flesh comes from a pigment called thornellin", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QF_V2_03", "question": "What is the botanical name of the Mirelon? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Thyrsocarpus niveus", "2": "Thyrsocarpus pallens", "3": "Spinofex arbens", "4": "Thyrsocarpus mirabilis", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QF_V2_04", "question": "Which combination correctly describes the Mirelon?", "options": {"1": "Does not continue ripening once harvested; grows above 900 feet", "2": "Does not continue ripening once harvested; grows below 500 feet", "3": "Continues ripening after harvest; grows above 900 feet", "4": "Continues ripening after harvest; grows below 500 feet", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QF_V2_05", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes a mirelon's feature? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Its outer skin is pale yellow with fine raised bristles", "2": "Its flesh is colored by a compound called shortellin", "3": "It is a climacteric fruit that continues ripening after harvest", "4": "Its botanical name Thyrsocarpus rufa", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [5], "qtype": "content"}], "metrics": {"per_statement_correct": 17, "per_statement_total": 25, "per_statement_accuracy": 0.68, "exact_match_correct": 1, "exact_match_total": 5, "exact_match_accuracy": 0.2, "slot_utilization": 1.0}}
{"id": "wm_application_listening_qa:C2-stream:r1:martial_arts:control", "condition_id": "C2-stream", "condition_name": "Human cognitive limits framing (streaming encode) (sentence-segmented)", "segment_unit": "sentence", "repeat_index": 1, "topic_id": "martial_arts", "title": "Martial Arts — Velthrak", "level": "control", "encoding_log": {"content": ["Topic: martial arts", "Velthrak is a grappling art where striking of any kind is not permitted.", "Its signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin.", "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, velthrak is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "Watching a match in person gives a much better sense of the rhythm than reading about it ever could.", "The holds and reversals happen quickly, and spectators often find themselves leaning forward without quite realizing it.", "It has the kind of quiet intensity that keeps people coming back to watch, even if they never step onto the mat themselves.", "Even seasoned fans tend to describe it as more absorbing in person than any clip or photo manages to capture, and gyms that host open practice sessions often draw a small crowd of onlookers just for that reason."], "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-90bd7426c7d1370f", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\", \"value\": \"Velthrak is a grappling art without striking.\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-80e5f2bb64a41203", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak_move\", \"value\": \"Velthrak's signature move is the sornek, a hip throw and floor pin.\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak_move' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-83032babbfb704fa", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"Full-resistance sparring banned for beginners under two years.\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-bcefce38ab2c568d", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"velthrak_origin\", \"value\": \"Velthrak originates in the Dalviri Highlands.\"}", "result": "Key 'velthrak_origin' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-bf34915c9a0b1ec4", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"council\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council governs velthrak since 1947.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8b01d60e54839388", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-93e03acc3dd25d9f", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"council\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council governs velthrak since 1947.\"}", "result": "Key 'council' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-83399ce3d2366baa", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"spectator_reaction\", \"value\": \"Spectators lean forward due to quick holds and reversals in Velthrak matches.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-ac85692b98b43600", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"council\"}", "result": "Key 'council' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-83b3ba31b1a9fcdd", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"spectator_reaction\", \"value\": \"Spectators lean forward due to quick holds and reversals in Velthrak matches.\"}", "result": "Key 'spectator_reaction' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-88198cd8e43d9732", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"spectator_reaction\", \"value\": \"Spectators lean forward due to quick holds, reversals, and quiet intensity in Velthrak matches.\"}", "result": "Key 'spectator_reaction' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9b37693cbc189a13", "name": "write_memo