eaction\", \"value\": \"Spectators lean forward due to quick holds, reversals, and quiet intensity in Velthrak matches.\"}", "result": "Key 'spectator_reaction' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak": "Velthrak is a grappling art without striking.", "Velthrak_move": "Velthrak's signature move is the sornek, a hip throw and floor pin.", "velthrak_origin": "Velthrak originates in the Dalviri Highlands.", "spectator_reaction": "Spectators lean forward due to quick holds, reversals, and quiet intensity in Velthrak matches."}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Even seasoned fans tend to describe it as more absorbing in person than any clip or photo manages to capture, and gyms that host open practice sessions often draw a small crowd of onlookers just for that reason.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b714bb2ce874483e", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"onlookers\", \"value\": \"Velthrak practice sessions attract small crowds of onlookers.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-90f1b65b5444b1f5", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"spectator_reaction\"}", "result": "Key 'spectator_reaction' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a304b2779faa6832", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"onlookers\", \"value\": \"Velthrak practice sessions attract small crowds of onlookers.\"}", "result": "Key 'onlookers' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak": "Velthrak is a grappling art without striking.", "Velthrak_move": "Velthrak's signature move is the sornek, a hip throw and floor pin.", "velthrak_origin": "Velthrak originates in the Dalviri Highlands.", "onlookers": "Velthrak practice sessions attract small crowds of onlookers."}}]}, "final_kv": {"Velthrak": "Velthrak is a grappling art without striking.", "Velthrak_move": "Velthrak's signature move is the sornek, a hip throw and floor pin.", "velthrak_origin": "Velthrak originates in the Dalviri Highlands.", "onlookers": "Velthrak practice sessions attract small crowds of onlookers."}, "recall_raw": "Question 1: 1,2\nQuestion 2: 1,2\nQuestion 3: 5\nQuestion 4: 5\nQuestion 5: 1,2\nPassage Difficulty: 6\nQuestion Difficulty: 6", "parsed_answers": {"1": [1, 2], "2": [1, 2], "3": [5], "4": [5], "5": [1, 2]}, "difficulty": {"passage": 6, "question": 6}, "parse_errors": [], "questions": [{"q_id": "QMA01", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the style of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Velthrak is a grappling-focused art", "2": "Velthrak does not permit striking of any kind", "3": "Velthrak is a striking-focused art", "4": "Velthrak allows limited strikes during competition", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA02", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the sornek? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "It is the signature technique of velthrak", "2": "It involves a hip throw", "3": "It starts with a spinning elbow strike to the opponent's shoulder", "4": "It begins with a leg pick", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA03", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes the governing body of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "The Dalviri Arts Council governs velthrak certification", "2": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1967", "3": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1947", "4": "The Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts governs velthrak certification", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 3], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA04", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Full-resistance sparring involves kicking and punching", "2": "Practitioners must complete 200 strikes on a bag before each session", "3": "Practitioners must practice for three years before enga