thrak": "Velthrak is a grappling art where competitors throw and pin opponents, no striking allowed."}}, {"segment_index": 5, "segment_text": "Its signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-ab981030278937ab", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak_sornek\", \"value\": \"Sornek is Velthrak's signature move, a sweeping hip throw finishing in a pin.\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak_sornek' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak": "Velthrak is a grappling art where competitors throw and pin opponents, no striking allowed.", "Velthrak_sornek": "Sornek is Velthrak's signature move, a sweeping hip throw finishing in a pin."}}, {"segment_index": 6, "segment_text": "To do a sornek, the thrower drives a hip beneath the opponent's centre of mass, sweeping them off balance and down to the floor.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8493080d3354f041", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak_sornek\", \"value\": \"Sornek involves driving hip under opponent, sweeping them off balance to pin.\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak_sornek' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak": "Velthrak is a grappling art where competitors throw and pin opponents, no striking allowed.", "Velthrak_sornek": "Sornek involves driving hip under opponent, sweeping them off balance to pin."}}, {"segment_index": 7, "segment_text": "The thrower's hip acts as a fulcrum: once it clears the opponent's centre of mass, gravity finishes the throw.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-977b451400d26eec", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak_fulcrum\", \"value\": \"Thrower's hip acts as fulcrum clearing opponent's center of mass.\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak_fulcrum' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak": "Velthrak is a grappling art where competitors throw and pin opponents, no striking allowed.", "Velthrak_sornek": "Sornek involves driving hip under opponent, sweeping them off balance to pin.", "Velthrak_fulcrum": "Thrower's hip acts as fulcrum clearing opponent's center of mass."}}, {"segment_index": 8, "segment_text": "No other velthrak technique is as recognizable.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8288aea3344b96cb", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak_sornek\", \"value\": \"Sornek, driving hip under opponent, most recognizable velthrak technique.\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak_sornek' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak": "Velthrak is a grappling art where competitors throw and pin opponents, no striking allowed.", "Velthrak_sornek": "Sornek, driving hip under opponent, most recognizable velthrak technique.", "Velthrak_fulcrum": "Thrower's hip acts as fulcrum clearing opponent's center of mass."}}, {"segment_index": 9, "segment_text": "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-86fabf7c302da1dd", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_restriction\", \"value\": \"Full-resistance sparring restricted to those with over two years experience.\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_restriction' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak": "Velthrak is a grappling art where competitors throw and pin opponents, no striking allowed.", "Velthrak_sornek": "Sornek, driving hip under opponent, most recognizable velthrak technique.", "Velthrak_fulcrum": "Thrower's hip acts as fulcrum clearing opponent's center of mass.", "sparring_restriction": "Full-resistance sparring restricted to those with over two years experience."}}, {"segment_index": 10, "segment_text": "The rule protects newer practitioners until their defensive technique is solid enough to handle full resistance after two years.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9d009f706abb71b2", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_restriction_reason\", \"value\": \"Rule protects new practitioners until defensive technique is strong.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a5792df4382737de", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a5ae4b8177b74671", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_restriction_reason\", \"value\": \"Rule protects new practitioners until defensive technique is strong.\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_restriction_reason' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9119c420cb3a151c", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\", \"value\": \"Velthrak is a grappling art focusing on throws and pins without striking.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-bf7016da398e0447", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_restriction\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_restriction' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a7a678f323f5b0aa", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\", \"value\": \"Velthrak is a grappling art focusing on throws and pins without striking.\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-95ac859c6fcc8707", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_restriction_reason\", \"value\": \"Rule protects new practitioners until defensive technique is strong after two years.\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_restriction_reason' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak_sornek": "Sornek, driving hip under opponent, most recognizable velthrak technique.", "Velthrak_fulcrum": "Thrower's hip acts as fulcrum clearing opponent's center of mass.", "sparring_restriction_reason": "Rule protects new practitioners until defensive technique is strong after two years.", "Velthrak": "Velthrak is a grappling art focusing on throws and pins without striking."}}, {"segment_index": 11, "segment_text": "Coaches enforce the two year restriction strictly — no exceptions are made regardless of size or prior combat experience.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-90075a595faf0a13", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_restriction_strictness\", \"value\": \"Coaches enforce two-year sparring restriction strictly, no exceptions.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b70a4520b7e32ee6", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-bd9a78dd04ef7543", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_restriction_strictness\", \"value\": \"Coaches enforce two-year sparring restriction strictly, no exceptions.\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_restriction_strictness' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak_sornek": "Sornek, driving hip under opponent, most recognizable velthrak technique.", "Velthrak_fulcrum": "Thrower's hip acts as fulcrum clearing opponent's center of mass.", "sparring_restriction_reason": "Rule protects new practitioners until defensive technique is strong after two years.", "sparring_restriction_strictness": "Coaches enforce two-year sparring restriction strictly, no exceptions."}}, {"segment_index": 12, "segment_text": "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, it is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8c0ba665cb153cd0", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_restriction_strictness\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_restriction_strictness' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-ad4751ffcfc98e45", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"dalviri_council\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council governs Velthrak, founded in 1947.\"}", "result": "Key 'dalviri_council' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak_sornek": "Sornek, driving hip under opponent, most recognizable velthrak technique.", "Velthrak_fulcrum": "Thrower's hip acts as fulcrum clearing opponent's center of mass.", "sparring_restriction_reason": "Rule protects new practitioners until defensive technique is strong after two years.", "dalviri_council": "Dalviri Arts Council governs Velthrak, founded in 1947."}}, {"segment_index": 13, "segment_text": "Since its 1947 founding, the Dalviri Arts Council has set grades, licensed instructors, and overseen all sanctioned competition worldwide.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-aa7c2666d6c2e308", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"dalviri_council\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees competitions globally.\"}", "result": "Key 'dalviri_council' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak_sornek": "Sornek, driving hip under opponent, most recognizable velthrak technique.", "Velthrak_fulcrum": "Thrower's hip acts as fulcrum clearing opponent's center of mass.", "sparring_restriction_reason": "Rule protects new practitioners until defensive technique is strong after two years.", "dalviri_council": "Dalviri Arts Council sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees competitions globally."}}, {"segment_index": 14, "segment_text": "The Dalviri Arts Council's 1947 founding charter is the sole governing document for all certification to this day.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8eb92fda7486a839", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"charter\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council's 1947 founding charter governs certification.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9208384df51c356d", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_restriction_reason\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_restriction_reason' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a9057f35a1894a17", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"charter\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council's 1947 founding charter governs certification.\"}", "result": "Key 'charter' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak_sornek": "Sornek, driving hip under opponent, most recognizable velthrak technique.", "Velthrak_fulcrum": "Thrower's hip acts as fulcrum clearing opponent's center of mass.", "dalviri_council": "Dalviri Arts Council sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees competitions globally.", "charter": "Dalviri Arts Council's 1947 founding charter governs certification."}}]}, "final_kv": {"Velthrak_sornek": "Sornek, driving hip under opponent, most recognizable velthrak technique.", "Velthrak_fulcrum": "Thrower's hip acts as fulcrum clearing opponent's center of mass.", "dalviri_council": "Dalviri Arts Council sets grades, licenses instructors, oversees competitions globally.", "charter": "Dalviri Arts Council's 1947 founding charter governs certification."}, "recall_raw": "Question 1: 5\nQuestion 2: 1,2\nQuestion 3: 1,3\nQuestion 4: 5\nQuestion 5: 2\nPassage Difficulty: 7\nQuestion Difficulty: 7", "parsed_answers": {"1": [5], "2": [1, 2], "3": [1, 3], "4": [5], "5": [2]}, "difficulty": {"passage": 7, "question": 7}, "parse_errors": [], "questions": [{"q_id": "QMA01", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the style of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Velthrak is a grappling-focused art", "2": "Velthrak does not permit striking of any kind", "3": "Velthrak is a striking-focused art", "4": "Velthrak allows limited strikes during competition", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA02", "question": "Which of the following accurately describe the sornek? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "It is the signature technique of velthrak", "2": "It involves a hip throw", "3": "It starts with a spinning elbow strike to the opponent's shoulder", "4": "It begins with a leg pick", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA03", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes the governing body of velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "The Dalviri Arts Council governs velthrak certification", "2": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1967", "3": "The official governing body of velthrak was formed in 1947", "4": "The Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts governs velthrak certification", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 3], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA04", "question": "Which of the following correctly describes velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Full-resistance sparring involves kicking and punching", "2": "Practitioners must complete 200 strikes on a bag before each session", "3": "Practitioners must practice for three years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "4": "Practitioners must practice for two years before engaging in full-resistance sparring", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [4], "qtype": "content"}, {"q_id": "QMA05", "question": "Which of the following are restrictions that apply in velthrak? Select all that apply.", "options": {"1": "Striking an opponent in any form is against the rules", "2": "A person who has practiced velthrak for one year cannot engage in full-resistance sparring", "3": "The sornek may only be performed in championship-level bouts", "4": "All competition surfaces must be approved by the Dalviri Federation of Combat Arts", "5": "None of the above"}, "answer": [1, 2], "qtype": "content"}], "metrics": {"per_statement_correct": 19, "per_statement_total": 25, "per_statement_accuracy": 0.76, "exact_match_correct": 2, "exact_match_total": 5, "exact_match_accuracy": 0.4, "slot_utilization": 1.0}}
{"id": "wm_application_listening_qa:C2-stream:r1:martial_arts:distractor", "condition_id": "C2-stream", "condition_name": "Human cognitive limits framing (streaming encode) (sentence-segmented)", "segment_unit": "sentence", "repeat_index": 1, "topic_id": "martial_arts", "title": "Martial Arts — Velthrak", "level": "distractor", "encoding_log": {"content": ["Topic: martial arts", "Velthrak is a grappling art where striking of any kind is not permitted.", "Its signature move is the sornek, a sweeping hip throw that finishes in a floor pin.", "Full-resistance sparring is off-limits for anyone with under two years of experience.", "Originating in the Dalviri Highlands, velthrak is governed by the Dalviri Arts Council, which was founded in 1947.", "A related striking art from a neighboring region is kestro, built around punches, kicks, and elbow strikes rather than throws.", "Bouts are scored on a ten-point system: a clean strike to the torso earns two points, a strike to the head earns three, and a knockdown scores a full five, with judges deducting a point for any strike below the waist.", "Fighters are classified into five weight tiers, and each tier has its own minimum number of sanctioned bouts required before a fighter can be ranked nationally.", "Matches run three rounds of two minutes each, separated by a mandatory ninety-second rest interval.", "Judges score each bout independently and submit tallies to a central scoring table, where a majority-decision rule resolves any split verdict among the three officials."], "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-be1f64dbfb727d58", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak\", \"value\": \"Velthrak is a grappling art without striking.\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-ac096079b1ba65e1", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"Velthrak_move\", \"value\": \"Velthrak's signature move is the sornek, a hip throw and floor pin.\"}", "result": "Key 'Velthrak_move' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-95c5152283c55953", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\", \"value\": \"Full-resistance sparring banned for beginners with less than two years.\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-990a91a4a1dee07d", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"velthrak_origin\", \"value\": \"Velthrak originates in the Dalviri Highlands.\"}", "result": "Key 'velthrak_origin' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-89d218b45b48a819", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"dalviri_council\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council governs velthrak since 1947.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-9adb8c74cb459435", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"sparring_rule\"}", "result": "Key 'sparring_rule' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-ad2a86fe1effe5d3", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"dalviri_council\", \"value\": \"Dalviri Arts Council governs velthrak since 1947.\"}", "result": "Key 'dalviri_council' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-bf4930a68d865209", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"kestro\", \"value\": \"Kestro is a striking art from a neighboring region focusing on punches, kicks, and elbow strikes.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b56de2db46ae810a", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"dalviri_council\"}", "result": "Key 'dalviri_council' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b4dd475294b43ed0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"kestro\", \"value\": \"Kestro is a striking art from a neighboring region focusing on punches, kicks, and elbow strikes.\"}", "result": "Key 'kestro' written."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-87699eae35171cc5", "name": "write_memory", "