move is the sornek, a hip throw and floor pin.", "velthrak_origin": "Velthrak originates in the Dalviri Highlands.", "dalviri_council": "Dalviri Arts Council governs velthrak since 1947."}}, {"segment_index": 6, "segment_text": "A related striking art from a neighboring region is kestro, built around punches, kicks, and elbow strikes rather than throws.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-bf4930a68d865209", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"kestro\", \"value\": \"Kestro is a striking art from a neighboring region focusing on punches, kicks, and elbow strikes.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete an existing key first or overwrite one."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b56de2db46ae810a", "name": "delete_key", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"dalviri_council\"}", "result": "Key 'dalviri_council' deleted."}, {"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-b4dd475294b43ed0", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"kestro\", \"value\": \"Kestro is a striking art from a neighboring region focusing on punches, kicks, and elbow strikes.\"}", "result": "Key 'kestro' written."}], "kv_snapshot": {"Velthrak": "Velthrak is a grappling art without striking.", "Velthrak_move": "Velthrak's signature move is the sornek, a hip throw and floor pin.", "velthrak_origin": "Velthrak originates in the Dalviri Highlands.", "kestro": "Kestro is a striking art from a neighboring region focusing on punches, kicks, and elbow strikes."}}, {"segment_index": 7, "segment_text": "Bouts are scored on a ten-point system: a clean strike to the torso earns two points, a strike to the head earns three, and a knockdown scores a full five, with judges deducting a point for any strike below the waist.", "tool_calls": [{"tool_call_id": "chatcmpl-tool-87699eae35171cc5", "name": "write_memory", "arguments": "{\"key\": \"scoring_system\", \"value\": \"Bouts scored on ten-point system: torso 2 points, head 3, knockdown 5.\"}", "result": "Error: memory is full (4 keys). Delete a